            <category term="poetry"/>

        <updated>2026-09-06T09:21:19-07:00</updated>
            <summary type="html">
                <![CDATA[
                        <img src="https://www.jujubemonster.com/media/posts/143/tutu-2.png" alt="a cute lonely rabbit sitting on the counter of a bar, retro photography" />
                    There is a solitude of space A solitude of sea A solitude of death, but these Society shall be Compared with that profounder site That polar privacy A soul admitted to itself – Finite infinity. -- Emily Dickinson
                ]]>
            </summary>
        <content type="html">
            <![CDATA[
                    <p><img src="https://www.jujubemonster.com/media/posts/143/tutu-2.png" class="type:primaryImage" alt="a cute lonely rabbit sitting on the counter of a bar, retro photography" /></p>
                <p>There is a solitude of space <br>A solitude of sea <br>A solitude of death, but these <br>Society shall be <br>Compared with that profounder site <br>That polar privacy <br>A soul admitted to itself – <br>Finite infinity.</p>
<p>-- Emily Dickinson</p>
<figure class="post__image"><img loading="lazy"  src="https://www.jujubemonster.com/media/posts/143/tutu.png" alt="a cute lonely rabbit sitting on the counter of a bar, retro photography " width="500" height="664"></figure>
